# custom layouts

custom layouts are loaded from the `layouts/` dir inside the [config](/config). each `.json` file becomes a named layout using its filename without the extension.

## format

the file must contain a `map` object. a `shift` object is optional and falls back to qwerty's shift mappings when omitted.

```json
{
  "map": {
    "A": "A",
    "S": "O",
    "D": "E",
    "F": "U",
    // ...
  },
  "shift": {
    "1": "!",
    "2": "@"
    // ...
  }
}
```

keys in `map` are physical key labels and values are the labels ditto displays. keys that are not included keep their original labels.
